- `src/components/QuestionnaireV2/builder/SubQuestionsList.tsx#L376-L400`: replace the `<p>` elements holding `t("group")` and `t("position")` with `Label` plus `htmlFor`, and give the `Select` trigger and position `Input` matching `id` values.

